  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-Sectoral Assistance for Vulnerable Persons in Northwest Syria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM proposes to provide humanitarian assistance to the most vulnerable populations inside northwest Syria (NWS) and support crisis-affected groups with food support, and early recovery and protection services. Through these activities, IOM plans to support 14,363 beneficiaries, including internally displaced persons (IDPs) and host community members.</narrative>
  </description>
